      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <h2 class="section-title">Before you set off</h2>
  <p>Switch on Go in the open and wait for the skyBlip light to flash green. That means Go knows its position. <%= link_to_page "radar", label: "Learn to read the radar" %>, then <%= link_to_page "phone", label: "connect your navigation app" %> if you use one. Read the <%= link_to_page "power", label: "power guide" %> for charging and storage.</p>
</section>

<section class="band band--tint">
  <h2 class="section-title">After the flight</h2>
  <p>Hold the button for two seconds to switch Go off, then charge over USB-C. The logo stays on the screen. To store Go for weeks or a whole winter, rest a finger on the pad and hold the button for two seconds instead: Go switches off with a blank screen. An image left that long leaves a permanent shadow. See <%= link_to_page "power", label: "the charging and storage guide" %>.</p>
  <%= render "shared/pager", page: @page %>
  <%= render "shared/cta" %>
</section>
